/**
 * @defgroup test_support_fake_stdio fake_stdio
 * @ingroup test_support_reference
 *
 * @brief Fake stdio backend for unit tests.
 *
 * @details
 * Provides a deterministic test double for stdio-dependent code. Tests can
 * configure stream contents, observe read/write/flush calls, inspect buffered
 * and flushed data, and inject fake standard streams instead of real runtime
 * stdio dependencies.
 */

